# Backup files left behind by some `cargo fix` / rustfmt workflows.
**/*.rs.bk

# Windows debug symbols and coverage instrumentation artifacts.
*.pdb
*.profraw
lcov.info

.DS_Store

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored. This workspace produces a
# binary (clackr), and binaries should commit their lockfile so builds are
# reproducible across contributors and CI. See:
# https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/faq.html#why-do-binaries-have-cargolock-in-version-control-but-not-libraries
